			x: 8.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			description: ["Run /hardcore enable to flip on real permadeath for this world - optional, and off by default. Die with it on and no Totem of Undying saves you: you're out, and you only come back as a spectator. With friends, the run ends once every player online is down; while someone is still standing, a death is a normal respawn. Changed your mind while you're still alive? /hardcore disable turns it back off."]
			icon: "minecraft:totem_of_undying"
			id: "5A1D9C3E7F208B46"
			shape: "circle"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "3F7B2E9C5A108D64"
